msgstr "格式化强制执行"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 572b7282b2ea425da40ac38c2916ddf4
msgid ""
"`.clang-format` exists at the repo root but is **not** run by FreeSWITCH "
"GitHub Actions. Do not assume a format-on-PR bot. Bundled `libs/srtp/` "
"has its own `.clang-format` and Travis `format.sh`; that is not the core "
"tree."
msgstr ""
"仓库根目录有 `.clang-format`，但 FreeSWITCH GitHub Actions **不会**运行它。不要假定存在 PR "
"自动格式化机器人。捆绑的 `libs/srtp/` 有自己的 `.clang-format` 和 Travis "
"`format.sh`；那不是核心树。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: ec17af7845cc464da2991f6a37bbd050
