#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: c9d9d319b6e54cf9979542ef5882ce9d
msgid "Commits"
msgstr "提交"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 94fed85646fe4243b3dd48320ff23b33
msgid ""
"Topic branch; one identifiable change per commit; present-tense "
"imperative subject typically &lt; 50 characters; body hard-wrapped 68–72 "
"characters; empty line after subject. Mention JIRA as `FS-XXXX` on its "
"own line; add `#resolve` if the commit closes it. Rebase onto upstream; "
"do not merge master into the topic branch."
msgstr ""
"主题分支；每次提交一个可识别的改动；现在时祈使语气的标题通常 &lt; 50 个字符；正文硬折行 68–72 个字符；标题后空一行。JIRA 以 "
"`FS-XXXX` 单独成行；若该提交关闭工单则加 `#resolve`。变基到上游；不要把 master 合并进主题分支。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:109
#: 73cf3242adb744e6809b3e0e6140fada a132f2e29e72462c8c531ee7e13125c7
msgid "`docs/SubmittingPatches`"
msgstr "`docs/SubmittingPatches`"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 95b05abdb5884e8f93379429b9153d4d
msgid "Review path"
msgstr "评审路径"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 9d8ffce6ee00496291f02e4ab290ec35
msgid ""
"GitHub pull requests are the inclusion path (`README.md`). CI on PR "
"open/sync: unit tests + scan-build (`ci.yml`). Mailing-list patches are "
"not the inclusion path (`docs/SubmittingPatches`)."
msgstr ""
"纳入路径是 GitHub pull request（`README.md`）。PR 打开/同步时的 CI：单元测试 + scan-"
"build（`ci.yml`）。邮件列表补丁不是纳入路径（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: e220452d058b4504a870ff93aa2d67ec
msgid "`README.md`; `docs/SubmittingPatches`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"
msgstr "`README.md`; `docs/SubmittingPatches`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:23
#: fb996f38fc044b44a6e266c46bb13db3
msgid ""
"Practical C style for this tree: **match surrounding code**, use "
"**tabs**, keep the **Emacs/VIM footer**, and treat root `.clang-format` "
"as the written style when you do format — not as a CI gate. There is no "
"uncrustify config."
msgstr ""
"本仓库实用的 C 风格：**与周围代码保持一致**、使用 **Tab**、保留 **Emacs/VIM 页脚**，需要格式化时以根目录 "
"`.clang-format` 为书面规范——而不是 CI 门禁。没有 uncrustify 配置。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:25
#: 28254c3cc26642f09c307eb0ce8891a7
msgid "Naming and Layout"
msgstr "命名与布局"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:27
#: af731afb20c84e6bb29d2187c0d5faa3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Core files**: `src/switch_<area>.c` with matching "
"`src/include/switch_<area>.h`. Process entry is `src/switch.c`. Public "
"umbrella header is `src/include/switch.h` — module authors include that, "
"not a private core `.c`. Prefer `switch_core_alloc` / "
"`switch_core_session_alloc` and pool-scoped `switch_mutex_*` / "
"`switch_thread_*` / `switch_socket_*` over raw "
"`malloc`/`pthread`/`socket` ([C "
"Runtime](../1.architecture/06-c-runtime.md))."
msgstr ""
"**核心文件**：`src/switch_<area>.c`，对应头文件 `src/include/switch_<area>.h`。进程入口是 "
"`src/switch.c`。对外总头文件是 `src/include/switch.h`——模块作者应包含它，而不是私有核心 `.c`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:28
#: 7472b1d649fb47b8bcfaac60f573067f
msgid ""
"**Modules**: `src/mod/<category>/mod_<name>/` with primary source "
"`mod_<name>.c` (or `.cpp`). Categories in this tree: `applications`, "
"`endpoints`, `codecs`, `say`, `event_handlers`, `formats`, `languages`, "
"`xml_int`, `loggers`, `dialplans`, `asr_tts`, `databases`, `timers`, "
"`directories`, `sdk`."
msgstr ""
"**模块**：`src/mod/<category>/mod_<name>/`，主源文件为 `mod_<name>.c`（或 "
"`.cpp`）。本仓库中的类别：`applications`、`endpoints`、`codecs`、`say`、`event_handlers`、`formats`、`languages`、`xml_int`、`loggers`、`dialplans`、`asr_tts`、`databases`、`timers`、`directories`、`sdk`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:29
#: 5f0f46b03ecd4c53a064f60284da2e22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Module API**: declare load/shutdown/runtime with "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`, `SWITCH_MODULE_SHUTDOWN_FUNCTION`, "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_RUNTIME_FUNCTION`, then "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION(mod_name, load, shutdown, runtime)` "
"(`src/include/switch_types.h`). That exported table plus the typed "
"interface bag is how the core is extended (in-process DSOs, lookup by "
"name): [Architecture — Loadable module "
"contract](../1.architecture/01-architecture.md#loadable-module-contract)."
" Skeleton: `src/mod/applications/mod_skel/` and "
"`build/standalone_module/mod_skel.c`."
msgstr ""
"**模块 API**：用 "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`、`SWITCH_MODULE_SHUTDOWN_FUNCTION`、`SWITCH_MODULE_RUNTIME_FUNCTION`"
" 声明 load/shutdown/runtime，然后 `SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION(mod_name, load, "
"shutdown, "
"runtime)`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。骨架：`src/mod/applications/mod_skel/`"
" 与 `build/standalone_module/mod_skel.c`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:30
#: bec7fc658fa34eedbe810c1f9c42e25a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Exported vs private**: symbols not meant to be exported are `static` "
"(`docs/SubmittingPatches`). Public core APIs use `SWITCH_DECLARE(...)` "
"(`src/include/switch_platform.h`). Register console APIs with "
"`SWITCH_ADD_API` and dialplan apps with `SWITCH_ADD_APP` "
"(`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`). Endpoint modules also fill "
"`switch_io_routines_t` and `switch_state_handler_table_t` "
"(`switch_module_interfaces.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**导出与私有**：不打算导出的符号用 `static`（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。公开核心 API 使用 "
"`SWITCH_DECLARE(...)`（`src/include/switch_platform.h`）。用 `SWITCH_ADD_API`"
" 注册控制台 API，用 `SWITCH_ADD_APP` "
"注册拨号计划应用（`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:31
#: 6ef97fc9e845451da7e1c175b09397ea
msgid ""
"**Config files**: `<feature>.conf.xml` under "
"`conf/<profile>/autoload_configs/` (or the module’s own `conf/` samples)."
" Runtime module load list is XML `<load module=\"mod_…\"/>`, not a "
"`src/mod/…` path."
msgstr ""
"**配置文件**：`<feature>.conf.xml`，位于 "
"`conf/<profile>/autoload_configs/`（或模块自带的 `conf/` 样例）。运行时模块加载列表是 XML "
"`<load module=\"mod_…\"/>`，不是 `src/mod/…` 路径。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:32
#: a29f436c85b34e5a8cd344cdf03d06fb
msgid ""
"**XML preprocessor**: `#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`. You cannot "
"comment out an `X-PRE-PROCESS` line — remove it "
"(`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`). Flattened dump is `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`; do "
"not edit it while the process is running."
msgstr ""
"**XML 预处理器**：`#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`。不能把 `X-PRE-PROCESS` "
"行注释掉——必须删掉（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`）。展开后的转储是 "
"`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`；进程运行时不要编辑它。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:33
#: 9e7453a346b545a7a1c98075cc1fe7c4
msgid ""
"**PKB**: English source lives in `man/` (not `docs/man/`, which is Unix "
"man pages). `man/pyproject.toml` is Sphinx/Poetry for this knowledge base"
" — **not** product runtime dependencies."
msgstr ""
"**PKB**：英文源在 `man/`（不是 `docs/man/`，后者是 Unix man "
"page）。`man/pyproject.toml` 是本知识库的 Sphinx/Poetry 依赖——**不是**产品运行时依赖。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:35
#: f276a929610f4dcf8e8201389e9fde9b
msgid "Two `modules.conf` files (do not mix)"
msgstr "两份 `modules.conf`（不要混用）"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 72b7846a22c5409caca6d01e6021ab1c
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 0af02b0e95264eedacad908a13fd9452
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 08a77f4fc29d4e1e8b25a73ac9cca049
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 19bc3eb3ce3c4bc5af6a598c249465e6
msgid ""
"`build/modules.conf.in` → copied to repo-root `modules.conf` by "
"`bootstrap.sh` if missing"
