#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 3bc08a38ee6548dc8c7451d949258e1f
msgid "**Build**: which `src/mod/<category>/mod_*` trees are compiled"
