#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: b5818a5743c0402a9d5af1441dbbe927
msgid ""
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` (installed under the "
"configuration root; `$prefix/conf/` for the documented `--disable-fhs` "
"developer install)"
