"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml`（安装在配置根下；文档所述 `--disable-"
"fhs` 开发者安装使用 `$prefix/conf/`）"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md
#: 04e8950e636943ed9f52ce2c3c6264c7
