#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:42
#: a390ea9311c14a388627c652d380e3df
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A module can be compiled and still not load, or listed in XML and missing"
" from `mod/` because it was commented out at build time. "
"`build/modules.conf.most` is the scan-build “almost everything” list, not"
" the default. The runtime `<load>` tag is parsed from the compiled XML "
"root (`switch_xml_open_cfg(\"modules.conf\")`), not by reading "
"`modules.conf.xml` as a standalone file: "
"[Architecture](../1.architecture/01-architecture.md#runtime-load-tag)."
msgstr ""
"模块可以编译了却不加载，也可以写在 XML 里却因构建时被注释而不在 `mod/` 中。`build/modules.conf.most` 是 "
"scan-build 的「几乎全部」列表，不是默认值。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:44
#: 3599031474ef44f7b8242435f9684b68
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:46
#: 06e7025831a64b83859a10f12ae9b230
msgid ""
"**Classification**: C APIs return `switch_status_t` "
"(`src/include/switch_types.h`). Common values: `SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TIMEOUT`, `SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_INTR`, `SWITCH_STATUS_NOTIMPL`, `SWITCH_STATUS_MEMERR`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_NOOP`, `SWITCH_STATUS_GENERR`, `SWITCH_STATUS_INUSE`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_BREAK`, `SWITCH_STATUS_SOCKERR`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_MORE_DATA`, `SWITCH_STATUS_NOTFOUND`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_UNLOAD`, `SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD`, `SWITCH_STATUS_IGNORE`,"
" `SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_SMALL`, `SWITCH_STATUS_FOUND`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_CONTINUE`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_NOT_INITALIZED`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_LATE`. Compare against"
" these constants; do not invent ad-hoc integer codes for core/module "
"APIs."
msgstr ""
"**分类**：C API 返回 "
"`switch_status_t`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。常见取值：`SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`、`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TIMEOUT`、`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART`、`SWITCH_STATUS_INTR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOTIMPL`、`SWITCH_STATUS_MEMERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOOP`、`SWITCH_STATUS_GENERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_INUSE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_BREAK`、`SWITCH_STATUS_SOCKERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_MORE_DATA`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOTFOUND`、`SWITCH_STATUS_UNLOAD`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD`、`SWITCH_STATUS_IGNORE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_SMALL`、`SWITCH_STATUS_FOUND`、`SWITCH_STATUS_CONTINUE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOT_INITALIZED`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_LATE`。与这些常量比较；不要为核心/模块"
" API 发明临时整数码。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:47
#: d6e8cf9f71d940928850d55c36b21e71
msgid ""
"**Load/runtime**: module load functions return `switch_status_t`. Runtime"
" threads that should not be rescheduled return `SWITCH_STATUS_TERM` (see "
"`mod_skel` comments). `SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD` means “never unload”."
msgstr ""
"**加载/运行时**：模块 load 函数返回 `switch_status_t`。不应再被调度的运行时线程返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`（见 `mod_skel` 注释）。`SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD` 表示「永不卸载」。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:48
#: e247a865b9314a61a109b91765816368
msgid ""
"**Media reads**: `SWITCH_READ_ACCEPTABLE(status)` treats `SUCCESS`, "
"`BREAK`, and `INUSE` as acceptable (`src/include/switch_utils.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**媒体读取**：`SWITCH_READ_ACCEPTABLE(status)` 把 `SUCCESS`、`BREAK` 和 `INUSE` "
"视为可接受（`src/include/switch_utils.h`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:49
#: 8d01f9d8665745f984826f9b34d1cc46
msgid ""
"**User-facing errors**: ESL replies are `+OK` / `-ERR` after `auth` "
"(`mod_event_socket.c` `parse_command()`). Console/API strings go through "
"`SWITCH_ADD_API`. Call teardown uses channel hangup causes, not a REST "
"error body. SIP status is Sofia’s problem, not a second core errno."
msgstr ""
"**面向用户的错误**：`auth` 之后 ESL 回复是 `+OK` / `-ERR`（`mod_event_socket.c` 的 "
"`parse_command()`）。控制台/API 字符串走 `SWITCH_ADD_API`。呼叫拆除使用信道挂断原因，不是 REST "
"错误体。SIP 状态是 Sofia 的事，不是第二套核心 errno。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:50
#: e364ce1e054044cbaacde51d095481b7
msgid ""
"**Null/empty strings**: use `zstr()` (`switch_utils.h`). "
"`switch_assert()` aborts on invariant failure (`switch_platform.h`) — not"
" a substitute for returning `SWITCH_STATUS_*` on expected failures."
msgstr ""
"**空/空字符串**：使用 `zstr()`（`switch_utils.h`）。`switch_assert()` "
"在不变量失败时中止（`switch_platform.h`）——不能代替在预期失败时返回 `SWITCH_STATUS_*`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:51
#: ad36470415ef4a4ab94afe406a4d4298
msgid ""
"**Retries or fallbacks**: there is no project-wide retry wrapper. "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART` / `BREAK` / `TIMEOUT` are control-flow statuses "
"for the caller. SIP retransmission lives in Sofia; do not add a generic "
"“retry three times” layer in new module code unless that module already "
"does so."
msgstr ""
"**重试或回退**：没有项目级的重试封装。`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART` / `BREAK` / `TIMEOUT` "
"是给调用方的控制流状态。SIP 重传在 Sofia 里；除非该模块已经这样做，否则不要在新模块代码里加一层通用的「重试三次」。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:53
#: 1b4aa98f705642fc9b222af9f79bc628
msgid "Logging and Diagnostics"
msgstr "日志与诊断"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:55
#: 192fa49e067f45bfbea081fc6c8fb391
msgid ""
"**API**: `switch_log_printf(SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG, SWITCH_LOG_<LEVEL>, "
"\"fmt\\n\", …)` (`src/include/switch_log.h`). The first argument is a "
"**channel macro** that supplies file, function, and line "
"(`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG`, `SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG_CLEAN`, "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)`, `SWITCH_CHANNEL_UUID_LOG(uuid)` in"
" `switch_types.h`). Optional JSON metadata: `switch_log_meta_printf`."
msgstr ""
"**API**：`switch_log_printf(SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG, SWITCH_LOG_<LEVEL>, "
"\"fmt\\n\", "
"…)`（`src/include/switch_log.h`）。第一个参数是**信道宏**，提供文件、函数和行号（`switch_types.h`"
" 中的 "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG_CLEAN`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_UUID_LOG(uuid)`）。可选"
" JSON 元数据：`switch_log_meta_printf`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:56
#: edf1f5ca7b8840d3b488fbcd1d713f45
msgid ""
"**Levels** (`switch_log_level_t`): `DEBUG10`…`DEBUG1`, then `DEBUG` (7), "
"`INFO` (6), `NOTICE` (5), `WARNING` (4), `ERROR` (3), `CRIT` (2), `ALERT`"
" (1), `CONSOLE` (0), plus `DISABLE` / `INVALID` / `UNINIT`. Prefer "
"`ERROR`/`CRIT` for failures, `WARNING` for recoverable misconfig, "
"`DEBUG`/`DEBUG1`+ for packet/session chatter."
msgstr ""
"**级别**（`switch_log_level_t`）：`DEBUG10`…`DEBUG1`，然后是 "
"`DEBUG`（7）、`INFO`（6）、`NOTICE`（5）、`WARNING`（4）、`ERROR`（3）、`CRIT`（2）、`ALERT`（1）、`CONSOLE`（0），再加上"
" `DISABLE` / `INVALID` / `UNINIT`。失败用 `ERROR`/`CRIT`，可恢复的错误配置用 "
"`WARNING`，包/会话噪声用 `DEBUG`/`DEBUG1`+。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:57
#: 527bdfa23f00489c97807ead894bc90a
msgid ""
"**Required fields**: file, function, and line are automatic via the "
"channel macros. Session-scoped logs should use "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)` so the UUID is attached. "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/logfile.conf.xml` can prefix lines with "
"the session UUID (`<param name=\"uuid\" value=\"true\"/>`). Log nodes "
"also carry timestamp and a sequence (`switch_log_node_t`)."
msgstr ""
"**必填字段**：文件、函数和行号由信道宏自动提供。会话范围的日志应使用 "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)` 以便附上 "
"UUID。`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/logfile.conf.xml` 可以在行前加上会话 "
"UUID（`<param name=\"uuid\" "
"value=\"true\"/>`）。日志节点还带时间戳和序号（`switch_log_node_t`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:58
#: fc76a805ae0f499d8ed25a92d5ab2aa9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Where it goes**: console mappings in `console.conf.xml` "
"(`$${console_loglevel}`); file logger `mod_logfile` (rotate-on-HUP, "
"rollover). Operators map by file name, function name, or `all`."
msgstr ""
"**去向**：控制台映射在 `console.conf.xml`（`$${console_loglevel}`）；文件记录器是 "
"`mod_logfile`（HUP 时轮转、按大小滚动）。运维可按文件名、函数名或 `all` 做映射。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:59
#: 7091370f3be4497e925af9aecd08892f
msgid ""
"**Debug workflow**: raise console/file maps for the file under study "
"(`mod_sofia.c`, `switch_core_state_machine.c`, …); `fs_cli` `/log debug`;"
" `freeswitch -c -nonat` for a foreground console. Unit tests often start "
"the core with `SCF_LOG_DISABLE` (`src/include/test/switch_test.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**调试流程**：提高正在研究的文件的控制台/文件映射（`mod_sofia.c`、`switch_core_state_machine.c` "
"等）；`fs_cli` `/log debug`；前台控制台用 `freeswitch -c -nonat`。单元测试常常以 "
"`SCF_LOG_DISABLE` 启动核心（`src/include/test/switch_test.h`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:60
#: cfd7c64caf69469ba52ec9ede0f197ab
msgid ""
"**Sensitive data policy**: never log ESL passwords, SIP digest "
"credentials, voicemail PINs, SignalWire PATs, or XML-RPC `auth-pass` at "
"info-or-higher in examples or new code as if they were production-safe. "
"Demo values (`ClueCon`, `default_password=1234`, users 1000–1019) are "
"**known-insecure samples**, not a logging exemption. Do not paste "
"production auth into PKB examples."
msgstr ""
"**敏感数据策略**：不要在示例或新代码里把 ESL 密码、SIP digest 凭据、语音信箱 PIN、SignalWire PAT 或 "
"XML-RPC `auth-pass` 以 info "
"及以上级别记日志，仿佛它们生产可用。演示值（`ClueCon`、`default_password=1234`、用户 "
"1000–1019）是**已知不安全的样例**，不是日志豁免。不要把生产认证贴进 PKB 示例。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:62
#: 5156ea6e0e3b4daf8a182d592ff76be6
msgid "Configuration and Secrets"
msgstr "配置与密钥"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:64
#: 1f8ec0e681b44429a0d9bc8821a43487
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Config sources**: XML under `conf/<profile>/` (vanilla is the demo "
"PBX). Preprocessor variables in `vars.xml` (`$${default_password}`, "
"`$${console_loglevel}`, …). Module settings in `autoload_configs/*.xml`. "
"Build-time module set: `modules.conf`. Install prefix and version: "
"`configure.ac`."
msgstr ""
"**配置来源**：`conf/<profile>/` 下的 XML（vanilla 是演示 PBX）。预处理器变量在 "
"`vars.xml`（`$${default_password}`、`$${console_loglevel}` 等）。模块设置在 "
"`autoload_configs/*.xml`。构建时模块集合：`modules.conf`。安装前缀和版本：`configure.ac`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:65
#: bcb5c5fcf5354354ae78cf3e451a9262
msgid ""
"**Override order**: preprocessor `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS` expands before "
"XML parse. Runtime `reloadxml` re-reads XML; it does not rebuild modules."
" Enabling a module requires **both** an uncommented build line **and** a "
"runtime `<load>` (unless you `load mod_*` from the console)."
msgstr ""
"**覆盖顺序**：预处理器 `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS` 在 XML 解析之前展开。运行时 `reloadxml` 会重新读取"
" XML；它不会重新编译模块。启用一个模块需要**同时**有未注释的构建行**以及**运行时 `<load>`（除非你从控制台 `load "
"mod_*`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:66
#: 2ab4c74b0aad474889e424336b21102f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Vanilla is demo, not production**: `conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`."
" Default directory users 1000–1019 share `$${default_password}` (`1234` "
"in `vars.xml`); voicemail PINs match the extension. Dialplan logs CRIT "
"and sleeps 10s while the password is still `1234` "
"(`conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`). Change passwords or run "
"`scripts/perl/randomize-passwords.pl`. Start with `-nonat` unless UPnP"
"/NAT-PMP pinholes are intentional."
msgstr ""
"**Vanilla 是演示，不是生产**：`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`。默认 directory 用户 "
"1000–1019 共用 `$${default_password}`（`vars.xml` 中为 `1234`）；语音信箱 PIN "
"与分机号相同。密码仍为 `1234` 时，拨号计划会打 CRIT 日志并睡眠 10 "
"秒（`conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`）。请改密码或运行 `scripts/perl/randomize-"
"passwords.pl`。除非有意做 UPnP/NAT-PMP 打孔，否则用 `-nonat` 启动。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:67
#: 7cd2863a25af42f1a6cc98fb6e8309e0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**ESL**: default password `ClueCon` "
"(`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml` listens on `::` "
"port 8021; the module sample in "
"`src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/conf/` binds `127.0.0.1`). "
"`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf` uses the same password. Commenting out `apply-"
"inbound-acl` still leaves the **`loopback.auto`** default — that is not "
"“no ACL”. **Change the password** and set an explicit inbound ACL before "
"any non-loopback exposure ([Remote Event Socket "
"ACL](../5.operations/01-runbook.md#remote-event-socket-acl)). Erlang "
"cookie samples also use `ClueCon`."
msgstr ""
"**ESL**：默认密码 "
"`ClueCon`（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml` 监听 `::` "
"端口 8021；模块样例 `src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/conf/` 绑定 "
"`127.0.0.1`）。`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf` 使用同一密码。在任何非回环暴露之前**务必改掉**。Erlang "
"cookie 样例也用 `ClueCon`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:68
#: 541d17e4ab904508806fa861173b5cb5
msgid ""
"**XML-RPC demo auth** (not in vanilla autoload): `auth-user` `freeswitch`"
" / `auth-pass` `works` "
"(`src/mod/xml_int/mod_xml_rpc/conf/autoload_configs/xml_rpc.conf.xml`)."
msgstr ""
"**XML-RPC 演示认证**（不在 vanilla autoload 中）：`auth-user` `freeswitch` / `auth-"
"pass` "
"`works`（`src/mod/xml_int/mod_xml_rpc/conf/autoload_configs/xml_rpc.conf.xml`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:69
#: 2532278169b0450dbc6fef2215fe29bf
msgid ""
"**Packaging secrets**: FSGET and packaged Docker images need a SignalWire"
" Personal Access Token (`scripts/packaging/README.md`). Pass the PAT on "
"the command line or as a Docker `TOKEN` build-arg — **never commit it**. "
"Source builds do not need that token "
"(`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`)."
msgstr ""
"**打包密钥**：FSGET 和打包的 Docker 镜像需要 SignalWire Personal Access "
"Token（`scripts/packaging/README.md`）。在命令行或 Docker `TOKEN` build-arg 传入 "
"PAT——**永远不要提交**。源码构建不需要该 token（`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:70
#: ea6f08e7028c4adfa365c3fbb5f62315
msgid ""
"**No secrets in git**: do not add PATs, production SIP passwords, TLS "
"private keys, or live ESL passwords to this repository. Demo XML that "
"already contains `ClueCon` / `1234` stays demo; new config must not copy "
"those values as if they were a baseline."
msgstr ""
"**密钥不要进 git**：不要把 PAT、生产 SIP 密码、TLS 私钥或线上 ESL 密码加入本仓库。已经含有 `ClueCon` / "
"`1234` 的演示 XML 继续当演示；新配置不得把这些值当成基线去复制。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:71
#: 7a33ff82699f4f7c84372ab060d3566e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Version bump**: keep together (comment in `configure.ac`): "
"`AC_INIT([freeswitch], […])`, `SWITCH_VERSION_MAJOR` / `MINOR` / `MICRO` "
"(and optional `REVISION` / `REVISION_HUMAN` for a tagged release), and "
"`build/next-release.txt`. See [Build](02-build.md)."
msgstr ""
"**版本号变更**：必须一起改（`configure.ac` 中的注释）：`AC_INIT([freeswitch], "
"[…])`、`SWITCH_VERSION_MAJOR` / `MINOR` / `MICRO`（打标签发布时还可选 `REVISION` / "
"`REVISION_HUMAN`），以及 `build/next-release.txt`。参见 [构建](08-build.md)。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:73
#: f757037be0d74632a0f9f8d1f10141b9
msgid "Testing and Review Expectations"
msgstr "测试与评审期望"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:75
#: c4b4f2284d374cdabce582ee6ecb0f65
msgid ""
"**Core unit tests**: Autotools programs under `tests/unit/` against "
"`libfreeswitch`. New tests **must** use `src/include/test/switch_test.h` "
"(`tests/unit/README`). Run `tests/unit/run-tests.sh` after "
"configure/build/install; CI chunks with `./run-tests.sh 2 1` (`ci.yml` "
"`TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`). ESL: `make -C libs/esl check` (CI group 1)."
msgstr ""
"**核心单元测试**：`tests/unit/` 下针对 `libfreeswitch` 的 Autotools 程序。新测试**必须**使用 "
"`src/include/test/switch_test.h`（`tests/unit/README`）。configure/build/install"
" 之后运行 `tests/unit/run-tests.sh`；CI 分片为 `./run-tests.sh 2 1`（`ci.yml` 的 "
"`TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`）。ESL：`make -C libs/esl check`（CI 第 1 组）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:76
#: 8d380fbd61d64150b669b56a7744bb7f
msgid ""
"**Module tests**: some modules ship `test/` trees (for example Sofia SIPp"
" under `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`). Enable the module in "
"**build** `modules.conf` before those tests can link."
msgstr ""
"**模块测试**：部分模块自带 `test/` 树（例如 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/` 下的 Sofia"
" SIPp）。这些测试要能链接，须先在**构建**用的 `modules.conf` 中启用该模块。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:77
#: 46c47f33cf0a434aa079b79beb4ef0ce
msgid ""
"**CI on a GitHub PR**: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (unit-test groups via "
"`ci.sh`, optional DinD, `scan-build`). Platform packs: `build.yml`, "
"`macos.yml`, `windows.yml`. Treat a red `ci.yml` as blocking."
msgstr ""
"**GitHub PR 上的 CI**：`.github/workflows/ci.yml`（经 `ci.sh` 的单元测试分组、可选 DinD"
"、`scan-build`）。平台包：`build.yml`、`macos.yml`、`windows.yml`。把变红的 `ci.yml` "
"视为阻断。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:78
#: 64eebb6534644fa4b51db7763441ea20
msgid ""
"**New module checklist** (`docs/SubmittingPatches`): `Makefile.am`; entry"
" in `configure.ac`; commented line in `build/modules.conf.in`; header "
"comments describing the module; whitespace footer; `static` for private "
"symbols; **do not** add files to `conf/vanilla`; commit body explains why"
" it exists and what is unfinished."
msgstr ""
"**新模块清单**（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）：`Makefile.am`；`configure.ac` "
"中的条目；`build/modules.conf.in` 中的注释行；描述模块的头注释；空白页脚；私有符号用 `static`；**不要**向 "
"`conf/vanilla` 添加文件；提交正文说明它为何存在、哪些尚未完成。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:79
#: 89ce6721887d4a1eb3fafe54cee33a5f
msgid ""
"**Docs for changes**: behavior, flags, or XML knobs belong in the commit "
"body. PKB pages under `man/` are English source for this knowledge base —"
" update the affected numbered page when layout, build, or conventions "
"change; do not treat `man/pyproject.toml` as a FreeSWITCH dependency "
"bump."
msgstr ""
"**变更文档**：行为、标志或 XML 旋钮写在提交正文。`man/` 下的 PKB "
"页是本知识库的英文源——布局、构建或约定变化时更新对应编号页；不要把 `man/pyproject.toml` 当成 FreeSWITCH "
"依赖升级。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:80
#: 1179dacd878a4f64bd52b1d2442e111d
msgid ""
"**Review focus**: media/SIP compatibility, module load vs build-list "
"mistakes, secret leakage in samples, rebase-clean history, scan-build "
"noise, and whether vanilla XML was treated as production."
msgstr ""
"**评审重点**：媒体/SIP 兼容性、模块加载与构建列表搞混、样例中的密钥泄漏、干净的变基历史、scan-build 噪声，以及是否把 "
"vanilla XML 当成了生产配置。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:82
#: 42629744e5ea43cb90fe6227b0cf01cc
msgid "Anti-Patterns"
msgstr "反模式"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:84
#: 70e881092cce45e9b4e4469d25f638b6
msgid ""
"Mixing **build** `modules.conf` / `build/modules.conf.in` with "
"**runtime** `conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` (different "
"files, different syntax, different effect)."
msgstr ""
"把**构建**用的 `modules.conf` / `build/modules.conf.in` 与**运行时**的 "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` 混为一谈（不同文件、不同语法、不同效果）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:85
#: 09e7a4f4ae864fed9ea07e8d43d9885e
msgid ""
"Treating `conf/vanilla` as a production baseline "
"(`README_IMPORTANT.txt`). Shipping `default_password=1234`, users "
"1000–1019, ESL `ClueCon`, or XML-RPC `works` as if they were safe."
msgstr ""
"把 `conf/vanilla` 当成生产基线（`README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。把 "
"`default_password=1234`、用户 1000–1019、ESL `ClueCon` 或 XML-RPC `works` "
"当作安全配置去发布。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:86
#: a32f72ffaf4241c48f6fdb69a48c1cd8
msgid ""
"Logging or documenting ESL `ClueCon` or SIP digest/voicemail secrets as "
"production-ready examples."
msgstr "把 ESL `ClueCon` 或 SIP digest/语音信箱密钥作为生产可用示例来记日志或写进文档。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:87
#: 74344b11a2fc45d2822850bbeee015f3
msgid ""
"Committing a SignalWire PAT, Docker `TOKEN`, or any live credential. "
"Putting secrets in git “just for CI”."
msgstr "提交 SignalWire PAT、Docker `TOKEN` 或任何线上凭据。把密钥放进 git「只是为了 CI」。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:88
#: 618953b0db8347cfa71522033430324c
msgid ""
"Bumping only `AC_INIT` or only `build/next-release.txt` instead of all "
"version fields together."
msgstr "只改 `AC_INIT` 或只改 `build/next-release.txt`，而不是所有版本字段一起改。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:89
#: f39453f7a57249d4a2447afa22f02ec0
msgid ""
"Whitespace-only or drive-by reformat mixed into a functional commit; "
"merge commits of master into a topic branch (`docs/SubmittingPatches`)."
msgstr "把纯空白或顺手重排混进功能提交；把 master 合并进主题分支（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:90
#: 782beedd353f418d8d175a3d669c395d
msgid ""
"Exporting internal module symbols; skipping `static`; omitting the "
"Emacs/VIM footer on new `*.[ch]`."
msgstr "导出模块内部符号；漏写 `static`；新 `*.[ch]` 省略 Emacs/VIM 页脚。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:91
#: 6f2fdfd1a5064e33811c9930fccaa445
msgid "Adding sample XML to `conf/vanilla` as part of a new module PR."
msgstr "在新模块 PR 中向 `conf/vanilla` 添加样例 XML。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:92
#: 5874643e020d40dcaffcab2029ee6c30
msgid ""
"Commenting out `X-PRE-PROCESS` lines, or editing `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` "
"while FreeSWITCH is running."
msgstr "把 `X-PRE-PROCESS` 行注释掉，或在 FreeSWITCH 运行时编辑 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:93
#: 13c02ace7f4f4aee8a607df93502bce7
msgid ""
"Starting a public-facing box without `-nonat` and without ACLs on SIP/ESL"
" ports."
msgstr "在面向公网的机器上启动时不加 `-nonat`，也不给 SIP/ESL 端口加 ACL。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:94
#: b882f61d1a264d15b32be2b74567ff67
msgid ""
"Commenting out `apply-inbound-acl` in `event_socket.conf.xml` and "
"treating that as “no ACL” (`mod_event_socket` still defaults to "
"`loopback.auto`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:95
#: f87c0456ff0c4ab1a970655e79326058
msgid ""
"Treating `docs/man/` as this PKB, or `man/pyproject.toml` as product "
"Python dependencies."
msgstr "把 `docs/man/` 当成这份 PKB，或把 `man/pyproject.toml` 当成产品 Python 依赖。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/01-conventions.md:96
#: c37840a1b990465bbe5a4e13ebc299c7
msgid ""
"Sending patches only to the mailing list and expecting them to land "
"(`docs/SubmittingPatches`); skipping GitHub PR CI (`README.md`, "
"`ci.yml`)."
msgstr ""
"只把补丁发到邮件列表并指望合入（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）；跳过 GitHub PR "
"CI（`README.md`、`ci.yml`）。"

